5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello. I think we should look at the actual problems. I'd like to check the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records, please.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"That's a very practical start, Daisuke! I'm curious about the human side of things. I'll look into the staffing of the coordination group and the in-house developer availability. Let's see who's actually doing the work!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Practicality is fine, but let's not forget the external variables. I'll look into network coverage at customer plants and the handling of vendor queries. It's always the things we can't control that bite us.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with the need for a balanced view. However, we must ensure the financial foundation is solid. I will look into the capital budget and software allowance, as well as vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Everyone is covering the basics! I want to see if we're repeating old mistakes. I'll look into the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts. Let's find a real winner!,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope those choices are okay. I just feel like the small, daily mistakes are often ignored. Does anyone else think we should focus more on those kinds of hidden losses?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, don't be so modest! Your focus is spot on. Those ""hidden losses"" are exactly where the real stress hides. I'm sure we'll find some juicy details that'll make the decision much easier.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your modesty is charming, but let's not get bogged down in the trivial. Small mistakes are symptoms; the real issue is usually a systemic failure in the groundwork. That's where the actual risk lies.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, systemic failures are often reflected in the budget. If we ignore the financial constraints and the long-term cost of licenses, we risk selecting a project that we cannot actually sustain after the first year.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Ryuji, you're totally right about sustainability! That's exactly why I'm checking the old rollouts. If we know what failed before, we can pick a project that actually lasts. Let's keep this energy going!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I see. I guess I'm just worried that we might overlook the people who are struggling every day. But... if everyone is looking at different things, maybe we'll get a full picture.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, exactly! We're like a puzzle, and each of us is grabbing a piece. I'll make sure we don't forget the people while the others handle the spreadsheets and systems. It'll be a blast!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, your enthusiasm is almost contagious, though I suspect ""a blast"" isn't exactly the goal of a budget meeting. Let's just hope the pieces of this puzzle actually fit together once we have the data.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the pieces will fit if we prioritize objective data over enthusiasm. I am less concerned with the ""blast"" and more concerned with whether the funding source is clearly defined before we commit.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Ryuji, objective data is great, but we can't ignore the human experience! I think if we combine the numbers with the actual results from the past, we'll find the perfect project. I'm excited to see what we find!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll try to be more confident. I just hope the data shows how much the staff is struggling. I'm looking forward to hearing what everyone else finds out.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,"That's the spirit, Daisuke! Just keep being you. I've got a feeling our findings are going to spark a very interesting conversation. I can't wait to see what's hiding in those reports!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's just hope the reports are actually accurate. I'll be interested to see if our ""full picture"" reveals the gaps we usually ignore until it's too late. I'm ready for the results.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Accuracy is paramount. I will analyze the financial data carefully to ensure we don't commit to a project that creates a deficit for next year. I look forward to the findings.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with you all! Let's just make sure we don't just look at the numbers, but actually learn from them. I'll be waiting to see if the past gives us a hint for the future!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
